ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-12T11:30:10Z","updated_at":"2019-04-12T11:30:10Z","body":" @elastic/es-core-infra Any Idea if it is a bug or I am miss-using the endpoint?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/482540332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"csenol","id":158265,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODI2NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol","html_url":"https://github.com/csenol","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csenol/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/482546056","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/41004#issuecomment-482546056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/41004","id":482546056,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4MjU0NjA1Ng==","user":{"login":"martijnvg","id":580421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MDQyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/580421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg","html_url":"https://github.com/martijnvg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martijnvg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-12T11:52:55Z","updated_at":"2019-04-12T11:52:55Z","body":"@csenol This is a bug. I've only tested it in the master branch, but there it fails because the execute api thinks there is no `field0`. The problem is that it isn't selecting the main (root) document here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/master/modules/lang-painless/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/painless/action/PainlessExecuteAction.java#L548\r\n\r\nIt is selecting a nested document and that document doesn't have a `field0`. I think fix would be to like the percolator select the right document with nested documents in mind: \r\nhttps://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/master/modules/percolator/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/percolator/PercolateQueryBuilder.java#L615\r\n\r\nWe can then use `Queries.newNonNestedFilter(...)` to figure which document is not nested and use its lucene docid instead of always using docid 0 (like is done in line 548).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/482546056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":